   "message": "Estate drift steamroll 2026-07-16: converge to RAPP canon\n\n- 'Prototyping Platform' -> 'Prototype Platform' (the acronym law) where flagged\n- retired v2/v3 rappid residue marked legacy/read-forever at each site (specs,\n  constitutions, vault docs, trackers, code comments, JSON bridges with\n  same-line notes) \u2014 history kept, nothing re-minted\nDriven by the shared rapp-drift-lint; this repo now lints clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
