   "message": "Refresh frozen spec: stop teaching the retired v2/name-hash mint (standing-guard)\n\nCommitted artifacts were already COMPLIANT, but the frozen specs/ still taught the\nretired identity: the v2 grammar and/or the cardinal-sin mint (uuid4().hex 32-hex,\nsha256(owner/repo)) and the old @rapp/origin species root. Refreshed the teaching to\nthe canonical \u00a76.1 form + keyless Hb(\"rapp/1:rappid\", uuid4) mint, with a supersession\nbanner. No identity bytes changed. This is the residue a schema-name-only pass missed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
